        <h3>An introduction, not a firm</h3>
        <p>We take enquiries and make introductions. We are not a CA firm, law firm, audit practice, tax authority or government service.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="trust-card">
        <h3>The professional does the work</h3>
        <p>Advice, filings and professional responsibility sit with the person you engage. We do not set their fees, so ask for yours in writing.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="trust-card">
        <h3>Evidence, not claims</h3>
