<section class="section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
  <div class="wrap faq-wrap">
    <div id="questions" class="questions">
        <h2 class="about__sub" id="faq-title">Questions people ask first</h2>
        <details>
          <summary>Is AccountOrbit a CA firm? Will you file my returns?</summary>
          <p>No to both. AccountOrbit is an independent referral platform. It does not employ accountants or perform accounting, audit, tax or legal work. Any filing is done by the professional you engage, and your responsibilities as the taxpayer continue.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What does this cost?</summary>
          <p>Fees for professional work are agreed between you and the professional, and AccountOrbit does not set them. Ask the professional for their fee and scope in writing before you engage them. Questions about AccountOrbit itself can be asked on the call. {% pending "whether enquiries are free, and how AccountOrbit earns money." %}</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Who will see my details?</summary>
          <p>Your details are used to review your enquiry, and are shared with a professional being considered for your work only if you have agreed. The {% routeLink "/privacy-policy/", "privacy policy" %} sets this out in full.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Will I definitely be matched?</summary>
          <p>An introduction is made only where a suitable professional is available for your work and your area. We will not describe someone as suitable just to close an enquiry. {% pending "how and when visitors are told when no introduction can be made." %}</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do you have an office in my area?</summary>
          <p>Please do not assume so. Naming a Delhi area on this site does not mean AccountOrbit or a professional has an office there. Ask any professional where they work from and whether they can visit.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Who runs AccountOrbit?</summary>
          <p>AccountOrbit is owned by {{ site.owner.name }}. You can find {{ site.owner.name }} on <a href="{{ site.owner.facebook }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Facebook<span class="visually-hidden"> (personal profile, opens in a new tab)</span></a> and <a href="{{ site.owner.instagram }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Instagram<span class="visually-hidden"> (personal profile, opens in a new tab)</span></a>. These are personal profiles, not AccountOrbit company pages. Read more <a href="/about-me/">about {{ site.owner.name }}</a>. {% pending "the operating entity behind AccountOrbit." %}</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>Do you list accounting jobs?</summary>
          <p>No. AccountOrbit is for people looking for accounting help, not for job seekers.</p>
        </details>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

